 `start` and `done`.
+
+Parse-time behaviour
+--------------------
+Task structure is driven entirely by ``config/tables.json`` (the snapshot that
+the deploy pipeline refreshes on every release).  The catalog HTTP service is
+**not** contacted at parse time, so the dag-processor never makes outbound
+requests while scanning this file, parse latency stays well under a second, and
+the DAG structure is fully deterministic — Airflow will not create a new version
+unless the snapshot actually changes.
+
